Recommendations

The `Shop` sends to the `Event stream`, with the label `clicks`. The `Trainer`
reads the `Event stream` with the label `read`, and writes to the `Model store`
with the label `write model`. The `Recommender` loads from the `Model store`,
with the label `load`, and the `Shop` asks the `Recommender`, with the label
`ask`.
---
Shop -> Event stream: clicks
Trainer -> Event stream: read
Trainer -> Model store: write model
Recommender -> Model store: load
Shop -> Recommender: ask
